  lawyer -> establish chain
  manager -> audit

IMPLEMENTATION FAILURE:
  student -> practical
  researcher -> experiment
  engineer -> deploy
  teacher -> execute lesson
  lawyer -> operationalize advice
  manager -> implement policy

ADVERSARIAL INTERACTION:
  student -> viva
  researcher -> peer review
  engineer -> design review
  teacher -> difficult class
  lawyer -> opposition
  manager -> negotiation

LONG PROJECT:
  student -> assignment
  researcher -> research
  engineer -> project
  teacher -> curriculum
  lawyer -> case
  manager -> organization

Same developmental operators.
Different roles.
Different consequences.

